The earlier query grouped by product, and personal loans came back with 26 distinct loans mentioning hardship. I'll submit a query that filters to personal loans directly.

_submit

{"action":"submit","query":"SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT l.loan_id) AS loans FROM svc_loans l JOIN svc_loan_notes n ON n.loan_id = l.loan_id WHERE l.product = 'personal' AND lower(n.note) LIKE '%hardship%'"}
